// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P437491158" "Take shard to Mr. Bocor"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P453422786" "Bocor has great info for us, I know it! Take him the shard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1533713856" "To tell you the truth, I never doubted you would succeed. And so I will keep my promise and tell you what I know. These shards, {VillainName}, are not dead, but alive. Moreover, they are not separate. They are part of the same great life force, and that force will someday be brought to bear on Sharkhead Isle. You have a role in this, {VillainName}; I believe that. What you choose to do with it will be most interesting to me. The shard you had best keep. I believe it will be worth much to you at a future date. <br><br>You had best be cautious of Silver Mantis and her mentor, Black Scorpion. I believe they are suspicious of the shards' power, though they do not yet know the whole truth. <br><br>A final warning: I counsel you not to share our discussion with young Miss Cage. She too is one over whom the hand of fate hovers greedily, ready to dispense fortune or doom. I would not want to see her take your destiny away from you, {VillainName}. You are far too intriguing for that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2581303623" "Bocor still wouldn't tell you anything? Unbelievable! And to think of all the risks we went through for him. I sure wish we could figure out what all the hoopla about that coral is. Hey, {VillainName}. Why're you smiling like that?"
// RandomFameString :
"P4233583749" "{VillainName}'s been going around with a big smile ever since talking to Bocor over in Port Oakes. I wonder what was said?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P671128385" "Crash Cage says {VillainName} got her square with the Circle."
